  "note": "Damage states of fort.emplacement. Built-in ImageGen reskin of templates/fort-emplacement-damage-guide.png (fort-emplacement-damage-guide.py, with the intact patch as material reference); exact prompt retained (fort-emplacement-damage.prompt.txt), raw retained unmodified, 1536x1024 RGBA. ImageGen did not hold the 192px pitch, so the rects here are measured and authoritative. Blocks fort.emplacement-damaged (left patch) and fort.emplacement-destroyed (right patch) use the intact block's wall-3x3 slots. The four edge cuts of each state are also doodads (doodad.fort-emplacement-damaged-<n|e|s|w> and -destroyed-<..>), the CoverPropDamage family the stamped parapets wear through; the inner-corner states are in fort-emplacement-corners. New sheet, shares no id with a shipped tileset.",
